# Homescool narrative language

When authoring or revising **Homescool** `.eoschool` JSON (level **6**, ≈ **8 years**), follow the full contract:

**[`docs/specs/009-homescool-narrative-language.md`](../../docs/specs/009-homescool-narrative-language.md)**

Also keep [`METHOD_V1.md`](../../frontend/public/skills/eoschool/METHOD_V1.md) pedagogy (intro/deepen/review, quiz counts, dual storage).

## Non-negotiables (summary)

- Split each `lesson.points[].body` with **blank lines** into Idea central → Explora → **`Práctica: Ahora te toca a ti.`** → **`Error común:`**.
- **Never** embed UI labels (`Idea central:`, `Explora:`, `explora:`) in the body text.
- **Never** use forbidden boilerplate listed in spec 009 (including «Antes de terminar, un aviso», «Esta clase te ayuda a aprender…», `Respuesta:` on MCQ choices).
- Adapt quizzes by **replacing** questions, not only prefixes.
- After cell edits: `node scripts/build-homescool-curriculum.mjs` with API env to refresh `curriculum.json` and Mongo.
